amples | Instruction Calibration | absent | No sample invocations or input/output pairs; `argument-hint` shows input format but the full deployment output sequence is not illustrated. |\n| 9 | Known Gotchas | Instruction Calibration | strong | Three domain-specific gotchas placed inline at relevant steps (image not pushed, test-skipping cost, migration rollback), each with concrete consequences and mitigations. |\n| 10 | Execution Checklist | Workflow Control | strong | Five numbered steps with explicit halt conditions (Steps 1, 2), canary threshold gate (Step 3), health check verification (Step 4), and conditional rollback flow (Step 5) with `--dry-run` early exit. |\n| 11 | Self-Correcting Loop | Workflow Control | present | Canary validation is mandatory and failure triggers auto-rollback, but there is no retry mechanism or maximum attempt count; a failing deploy is rolled back and stops. |\n| 12 | Plan-Validate-Execute | Workflow Control | present | `--dry-run` provides preview and canary validates before full promotion, but no explicit user approval gate exists between prerequisite validation and deployment execution. |\n| 13 | Utility Bundle | Executable Code | N/A | Deterministic work is handled by existing project scripts (`pre-deploy-check.sh`, `check-canary-metrics.sh`) and kubectl, not by scripts that should be bundled with the skill. |\n| 14 | Autonomy Calibration | Meta | present | `allowed-tools` restricts to `Bash` and `Read` and `user-invocable: true` is set, but no confirmation gate before deployment and `disable-model-invocation` is absent for a skill that modifies infrastructure. |\n\n**Summary**: 11 of 12 applicable patterns present, 7 of 12 strong, 5 improvements suggested\n\n### Activation Test\n\n**Description analyzed**: \"Deploy a service to the staging environment with health checks and rollback. Use when asked to depl...\"\n\n**Would trigger on**:\n- \"Deploy the auth service to staging\"\n- \"Push my-api to the staging environment\"\n- \"